(AI COLLEGE OF ENGINEERING & TECHNOLOGY) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Circular Ref No: AICET/ADMIN/2024/H-12  ) Tj
T* (Date: October 10, 2024  ) Tj
T* (Target Audience: All Students, Faculty, and Staff  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (NOTICE: DECLARATION OF HOLIDAY ON 12TH OCTOBER 2024) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This is to inform all students, faculty, and staff members that the college will remain closed on Saturday, 12th) Tj
T* (October 2024, on account of the public holiday.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Please note the following directives:) Tj
T* (1. Academic Activities: All scheduled lectures, practical sessions, and internal examinations for this day stand) Tj
T* (postponed. Rescheduled dates will be notified by the respective Department Heads.) Tj
T* (2. Administrative Offices: The administrative offices, library, and laboratory facilities will remain closed.) Tj
T* (3. Hostel & Essential Services: Hostel mess and campus security services will continue to operate as per) Tj
T* (standard holiday schedules.) Tj
T* (4. Resumption: The college will reopen and resume regular academic and administrative operations on Monday,) Tj
T* (14th October 2024.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (We wish everyone a safe and pleasant holiday.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (By Order of the Management,) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Dr. Aris Thorne  ) Tj
T* (Dean of Academics  ) Tj
